# a bare `jevcode` with no key anywhere (no --mock, every key variable unset, an empty HOME/XDG): the round-3 one-key wizard
# (TUI-DESIGN-3 §1.4, D-J) opens on the masked OpenRouter field under `setup · key` beneath the held mark (F-R8); Ctrl-C at
# the field prints the jev-on fix block (`export OPENROUTER_API_KEY=…   # one key: Jev + the code model`) and exits 2
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect OpenRouter API key
sleep 0.4
send \x03
eof
